  "2026-10-15T21:35:33.467Z",codex-agent,"Discovered while validating pm-vcs-00mb, pm-vcs-sl77 and pm-vcs-w3yi. The unchanged complete Bun release retry at e03471b exited 0: 1541/1541 passed, 0 fail/cancel/skip/todo, all 65 source files at per-file 100% coverage. The original control-metadata inspection refusal remains unexplained; focused success and a full retry do not remediate it. Keep this follow-up open; no scanner, publication test, safety bound or threshold was changed."
